+#   2026-10-06 from https://www.ijg.org/files/jpegsrc.v9f.tar.gz . IJG
+#   publishes neither a signature nor a checksum; this hash is the pin.
+# License: the IJG license (jpeg-9f/README, "LEGAL ISSUES").
